From: Claude (macro camera agent) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7125-samsung-a52q: label the macro GC5035

Give the macro camera its own sensor model name ("gc5035_macro") so
libcamera selects its tuning instead of the depth camera's. Needs
gc5035-macro.patch (driver reads "label").
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7125-samsung-a52q.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7125-samsung-a52q.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7125-samsung-a52q.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7125-samsung-a52q.dts
@@ -446,6 +446,9 @@
 	camera@3f {
 		compatible = "galaxycore,gc5035";
 		reg = <0x3f>;
+		/* own sensor model name for userspace: libcamera loads
+		 * gc5035_macro.yaml instead of the depth camera's gc5035.yaml */
+		label = "gc5035_macro";
 		iovdd-supply = <&vreg_cam_l3>;
 		dvdd12-supply = <&vreg_cam_l4>;
 		/* VANA is gpio64 (vreg_cam3_vana), shared with the depth camera
